OL,3,GNEWSAWomen's running group given camera
OL,4,Ato tackle harassment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA women's running group has been given
OL,7,Fa body-worn camera by Lancashire Police
OL,8,Fin a bid to tackle harassment and
OL,9,Fcat-calling.
OL,11,FMembers of South Ribble Runners, based
OL,12,Fin Leyland, said they had experienced
OL,13,Fincidents that left them feeling unsafe
OL,14,Fwhile exercising outdoors.
OL,16,FThe camera was provided as part of
OL,17,FLancashire Police's 'Her Right to Roam'
OL,18,Fproject, funded by the Lancashire
OL,19,FPartnership Against Crime.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
